@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
hide footbox
title 共享顺序图 A1 按可用复本激活预约
control "归还或入库控制对象" as Caller
control ReservationController as C
entity ReservationSlip as Slip
entity BookCopy as Copy
entity BorrowRecord as Loan
entity ReservationRecord as Queue
entity Reader as Reader
Caller -> C : activate(bookId)
C -> Slip : queryWaitingFIFO(bookId)
Slip --> C : waitingSlips 按 createdAt、slipId 升序
loop 按顺序逐单处理；库存用尽立即停止
 C -> Copy : allocateOne(bookId)
 Copy --> C : copyId 或 null
 alt copyId 非空
  C -> Loan : createPending(readerId, bookId, copyId, slipId)
  Loan --> C : borrowId
  C -> Slip : markReady(slipId)
  C -> Queue : markHandled(slipId)
  C -> Reader : get(readerId)
  Reader --> C : 联系方式
  C -> C : 将 slipId、读者、书目加入 noticeList
 else copyId 为 null
  break 无可用复本
   note over C,Slip : 本单及剩余单保持 WAITING_STOCK
  end
 end
end
C --> Caller : noticeList（只含本次成功激活单）
note over C,Queue
本流程加入调用方的 T3 或 T4 原子事务。
预约单、复本及借阅记录状态需一起更新。
end note
@enduml
